+# Caars.fi — Architecture (verified 2026-10-03)
+
+## Stack
+- Frontend: React 18 + Vite SPA (`src/`), prerender for SEO (`scripts/prerender.mjs`), Cloudflare Worker in front of caars.fi (`cloudflare-worker/`).
+- Backend: Lovable Cloud (one instance serves preview and production). Edge functions in `supabase/functions/`.
+- Git: Lovable-managed repository (remote `origin` = Lovable internal git storage, plus an S3 mirror). No GitHub remote is configured in this sandbox. Commits are created by the Lovable platform, not by the agent.
+
+## Payment routing (VERIFIED)
+- Stripe account: "Caars Autotuontiliike" (connected to this project). This is NOT the BRAI account seen in Codex.
+- Live webhook endpoint → `functions/v1/stripe-webhook`, status enabled, events: `checkout.session.completed`, `async_payment_succeeded`, `async_payment_failed`, `expired`.
+- `create-checkout`: server-side `PRICE_CATALOG` (client prices ignored). 79 € Perusselvitys / Etsintäpalvelu, 99 € Etsintäpalvelu +, 250 € TuontiApu, 1 290 € Avaimet käteen.
+- `verify-checkout-session`: success page only trusts a server-verified paid session; delayed methods → pending.
+
+## stripe-webhook flow (2026-10-03)
+1. Raw body + `stripe-signature` verified (`constructEventAsync`); missing/invalid → 400.
+2. `async_payment_failed` → logged, 200, no order/task. Other non-checkout events → 200.
+3. Unpaid `completed` → no order. Paid `completed` or `async_payment_succeeded` →
+4. Insert `orders` (unique `stripe_session_id`). AFTER INSERT trigger `cc_trigger_order_paid` → `cc_ensure_order_task` creates contact (if missing), case and exactly one task per order (`control_center_tasks.order_id` unique) in the same transaction.
+5. Duplicate delivery (23505) → load existing order, re-ensure task.
+6. `claim_order_side_effects` atomically claims emails/CRM/CAPI/admin notify for one delivery. Done → `side_effects_status='done'`. Failure → reset to `pending`, respond 503 so Stripe retries. Resend calls send `Idempotency-Key` per session.
+7. Any critical persistence error → 5xx (retryable). No detached background work, no timeout-based 200.
+
+## Key tables
+- `orders`: payment state (`status`), internal follow-up (`followup_status`), side-effect outbox (`side_effects_*`).
+- `control_center_tasks.order_id`: one fulfillment task per paid order.
+- Admin RPC `cc_reconcile_order_tasks(p_apply)`: dry-run/apply tasks for paid orders without one.

